  "menu.loading.ready": "World ready!",
  "menu.loading.tip_1": "Tip: Legend has it that deep caverns hide shimmering amethyst geodes and rare crystals.",
  "menu.loading.tip_2": "Tip: Beware of digging straight down. You never know where stone ends and lava begins.",
  "menu.loading.tip_3": "Tip: Winds and storms shift with time. Rainy days leave the wilderness lush and vibrant.",
  "menu.loading.tip_4": "Tip: Trees and wild flora thrive in harmony alongside small streams and rolling hills.",
  "menu.loading.tip_5": "Tip: The procedural horizon stretches for miles. Take a moment to watch the sunset sky.",
  "menu.loading.tip_6": "Tip: If you ever lose your way, build a tall pillar of blocks to serve as a makeshift beacon.",
  "menu.loading.tip_7": "Tip: Every block has its own unique acoustic resonance when broken or placed upon the ground.",
  "menu.loading.tip_8": "Tip: Nights can be peaceful and serene, ideal for watching the moon while enjoying the soundtrack.",
  "menu.loading.tip_9": "Tip: You can sculpt blocks into varied shapes and slopes for intricate architectural detail.",
  "menu.loading.tip_10": "Tip: No voxels were harmed during the procedural generation of this world.",
